{
  "title": "Easy Light Malaysian Vegetable Toast",
  "description": "A nutty and velvety Malaysian dish featuring vegetable shortening, toast, and a variety of vegetables, perfect for a quick and easy snack. This dish is made with dash-friendly ingredients and can be prepared in no time.",
  "cuisine": "Malaysian",
  "diet": [
